# Git discipline

- Never stage, commit, or push unless the user explicitly instructs it.
- Never reset, clean, stash, or discard unrelated working-tree changes.
- Preserve existing staged changes (including staged deletions).
- Review the diff before claiming completion.
- Avoid unrelated refactoring and silent contract changes.
- Do not modify reference repositories used only for study.
